        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Now Hiring: Daytime Security Guard for Apartment Complex&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work hours are 8:00 AM to 6:00 PM. The probationary period is 10 days. There are four main rules for security:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Always greet the residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Always have visitors write their real names on the visitor list.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Always patrol the apartment building at 3:00 PM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.Never speak to the woman in white.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Posting &amp; Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to post videos and stream this game regardless of whether you are an individual or corporation, and regardless of monetization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*If streaming the full version, please make sure to turn ON &quot;Streaming Mode&quot; in the in-game settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your content contains major spoilers (core story elements, later developments, etc.), please avoid including such content in your video titles or thumbnails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version may be freely streamed with or without spoilers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refer to the official website for detailed guidelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spend 10 days as a daytime security guard at a cursed apartment complex</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644630/extras/99d4f388e8cd94722678820e13f28029.avif?t=1780715596\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Pomegranate Housing Complex&quot; is a horror adventure game where you work as a security guard on day shifts from 8:00 AM to 6:00 PM for 10 days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you faithfully carry out your duties as a cog in the company machine, build relationships by interacting with residents and visitors, or investigate various objects to uncover the truth of Zakuro Danchi—it's all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >10 days of security work under time pressure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game time progresses in real time, and the speed can be set to three levels (slow, normal, fast). (Time pauses during certain commands and events.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can move between the security room and the apartment building, taking various actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you can do in the security room</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check security camera footage </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor four locations: 1st floor common area, 2nd and 3rd floor hallways, and the rooftop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644630/extras/2044c581c74868e1b3f8a817aded0683.avif?t=1780715596\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the resident list </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing your relationship with residents unlocks TIPS containing detailed information about them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644630/extras/201ed3c3ba38ff8b94e2404de8835b60.avif?t=1780715596\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with residents and visitors </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing your approach depending on the person may affect future story branches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644630/extras/bfb685e29c616e54480559b0e6d3b81a.avif?t=1780715596\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer phone calls </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reporting anomalies or irregularities to the management company increases your Order Level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644630/extras/53babe34142462afb537cb7daa837784.avif?t=1780715596\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check lost and found items </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage lost items discovered during patrols.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644630/extras/8ead2e9b1cd6514d6e0a2fba7ae5873e.avif?t=1780715596\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the manual </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Review security rules and work-related documents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644630/extras/3ef9da9cf491312338b5166b492b321b.avif?t=1780715596\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you can do in the apartment building</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrol each floor and the rooftop / Respond to anomalies </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrol the 1st floor common area, 2nd and 3rd floor hallways, rooftop, and in front of each room's door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644630/extras/086980ed8b9410dc095ab6c8443b7769.avif?t=1780715596\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate objects / Find lost items </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine various objects and discover/collect lost items during patrols.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644630/extras/110265ad99ae73212850a333798109a4.avif?t=1780715596\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rule violations erode &quot;everyday life&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644630/extras/1377e0d8e6de757b648b2bf1397f9c89.avif?t=1780715596\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security guards must follow certain rules. Violations increase the &quot;Spiritual Disturbance Level.&quot; The Spiritual Disturbance Level has 5 stages. Exceeding Level 5 renders the player unable to act. As the Spiritual Disturbance Level rises, supernatural phenomena occur and affect the screen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endings branch based on your actions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player actions are recorded as &quot;Order Level&quot; and &quot;Salvation Level.&quot; Taking actions the company desires (such as phone reports) increases Order Level, while showing compassion to residents and visitors increases Salvation Level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your adherence to rules and how you interact with residents, the story branches into multiple routes. Some events and outcomes only occur if specific conditions are met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several endings, and depending on the route you reach, the story may unfold completely differently. After reaching an ending, the &quot;Security Journal&quot; is unlocked, allowing you to review events discovered during the 10 days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Secrets hidden behind visitors and residents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Residents and visitors generally take specific actions at specific times on specific days. However, player intervention may cause changes in their behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you confront their pasts and emotional wounds—is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—Why. Why are you in a place like this?</p>",
